{"resource":{"id":"dbms-cheat-sheet","title":"DBMS \u2014 Cheat Sheet","category":"CS Core","difficulty":"Beginner","readingTime":"3 min","pages":2,"lastUpdated":"August 2026","tags":["DBMS","SQL"],"heroImage":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1516116216624-53e697fedbea?w=1800&q=80","heroSubtitle":"A 2-page printable DBMS + SQL quick reference \u2014 syntax, joins, keys, constraints, normal forms, ACID, indexing, and interview facts."},"toc":[{"id":"syntax","label":"1. SQL Syntax"},{"id":"commands","label":"2. SQL Commands"},{"id":"keys","label":"3. Keys"},{"id":"constraints","label":"4. Constraints"},{"id":"joins","label":"5. Joins"},{"id":"norm","label":"6. Normalization"},{"id":"acid","label":"7. ACID Properties"},{"id":"idx","label":"8. Indexing"},{"id":"tips","label":"9. Database Design Tips"},{"id":"quick","label":"10. Quick Reference"},{"id":"review","label":"Cheat Sheet Review"},{"id":"faqs","label":"FAQ"},{"id":"references","label":"References"},{"id":"disclaimer","label":"Disclaimer"}],"related":[{"title":"DBMS \u2014 Quick Revision Notes","tag":"CS Core","time":"10 min"},{"title":"DBMS \u2014 Reference Guide","tag":"CS Core","time":"33 min"},{"title":"DBMS \u2014 Interview Questions","tag":"CS Core","time":"32 min"}],"html":"<section id=\"syntax\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">1. SQL Syntax</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <Figure\n          src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1516116216624-53e697fedbea?w=1600&q=80\"\n          caption=\"Keep this cheat sheet pinned near your editor.\"\n        />\n        <div class=\"my-3 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs text-slate-400\"><span>python</span></div><pre class=\"overflow-x-auto p-4 text-[13px] leading-relaxed\"><code>SELECT col1, col2 FROM table\n[WHERE  cond]\n[GROUP  BY col]\n[HAVING agg-cond]\n[ORDER  BY col [ASC|DESC]]\n[LIMIT  n OFFSET m];</code></pre></div>\n        <div class=\"my-4 rounded-2xl border-l-4 border-amber-500/40 bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-900 dark:text-amber-100 p-4\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><div class=\"mt-0.5 shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-5 w-5\"><path d=\"M15 14c.2-1 .7-1.7 1.5-2.5 1-.9 1.5-2.2 1.5-3.5A6 6 0 0 0 6 8c0 1 .2 2.2 1.5 3.5.7.7 1.3 1.5 1.5 2.5\"/><path d=\"M9 18h6\"/><path d=\"M10 22h4\"/></svg></div><div class=\"min-w-0 flex-1\"><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold\">Logical order</p><div class=\"mt-1 text-sm\">FROM \u2192 WHERE \u2192 GROUP \u2192 HAVING \u2192 SELECT \u2192 ORDER \u2192 LIMIT.</div></div></div></div>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"commands\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">2. SQL Commands</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <div class=\"overflow-x-auto rounded-lg border border-border/60\">\n          <table class=\"w-full text-xs\">\n            <tbody>\n              <Row k=\"DDL\" v=\"CREATE \u00b7 ALTER \u00b7 DROP \u00b7 TRUNCATE \u00b7 RENAME\" />\n              <Row k=\"DML\" v=\"SELECT \u00b7 INSERT \u00b7 UPDATE \u00b7 DELETE \u00b7 MERGE\" />\n              <Row k=\"DCL\" v=\"GRANT \u00b7 REVOKE\" />\n              <Row k=\"TCL\" v=\"BEGIN \u00b7 COMMIT \u00b7 ROLLBACK \u00b7 SAVEPOINT\" />\n            </tbody>\n          </table>\n        </div>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"keys\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">3. Keys</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5 text-sm\">\n          <li>Super \u2287 Candidate \u2287 Primary \u00b7 Alternate = unused candidate.</li>\n          <li>Foreign key \u2192 parent PK.</li>\n          <li>Surrogate = synthetic BIGINT / UUID.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"constraints\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">4. Constraints</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <div class=\"overflow-x-auto rounded-lg border border-border/60\">\n          <table class=\"w-full text-xs\">\n            <tbody>\n              <Row k=\"NOT NULL\" v=\"column can't be NULL\" />\n              <Row k=\"UNIQUE\" v=\"column values distinct\" />\n              <Row k=\"PRIMARY KEY\" v=\"NOT NULL + UNIQUE + 1 per table\" />\n              <Row k=\"FOREIGN KEY\" v=\"references parent PK \u00b7 CASCADE / RESTRICT / SET NULL\" />\n              <Row k=\"CHECK\" v=\"boolean predicate per row\" />\n              <Row k=\"DEFAULT\" v=\"fallback value\" />\n            </tbody>\n          </table>\n        </div>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"joins\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">5. Joins</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <div class=\"overflow-x-auto rounded-lg border border-border/60\">\n          <table class=\"w-full text-xs\">\n            <tbody>\n              <Row k=\"INNER\" v=\"only matched rows\" />\n              <Row k=\"LEFT\" v=\"all left + matched right (NULL if none)\" />\n              <Row k=\"RIGHT\" v=\"mirror of LEFT\" />\n              <Row k=\"FULL\" v=\"union of LEFT + RIGHT\" />\n              <Row k=\"CROSS\" v=\"Cartesian product\" />\n              <Row k=\"LATERAL\" v=\"per-row correlated subquery\" />\n            </tbody>\n          </table>\n        </div>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"norm\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">6. Normalization</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5 text-sm\">\n          <li>1NF \u2014 atomic values.</li>\n          <li>2NF \u2014 no partial dependency.</li>\n          <li>3NF \u2014 no transitive dependency.</li>\n          <li>BCNF \u2014 every determinant is a superkey.</li>\n          <li>4NF \u2014 no multi-valued dependency.</li>\n          <li>5NF \u2014 no join dependency.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"acid\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">7. ACID Properties</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5 text-sm\">\n          <li><strong>A</strong>tomicity \u2014 all or nothing.</li>\n          <li><strong>C</strong>onsistency \u2014 rules preserved.</li>\n          <li><strong>I</strong>solation \u2014 concurrent txns look serial.</li>\n          <li><strong>D</strong>urability \u2014 committed writes survive crashes.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"idx\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">8. Indexing</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5 text-sm\">\n          <li>B-tree default \u00b7 GIN for JSON / arrays / FTS \u00b7 GiST for geo \u00b7 BRIN for huge ordered tables.</li>\n          <li>Composite (a,b) \u2192 WHERE a=\u2026, a=\u2026 AND b=\u2026, ORDER BY a,b.</li>\n          <li>Covering index answers query without heap fetch.</li>\n          <li>Every extra index slows writes.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"tips\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">9. Database Design Tips</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5 text-sm\">\n          <li>Prefer surrogate primary keys.</li>\n          <li>Every FK gets an index.</li>\n          <li>Store dates as TIMESTAMPTZ, money as NUMERIC.</li>\n          <li>Use ENUM / lookup tables for constrained sets.</li>\n          <li>Migrate with reversible up/down scripts, no manual SQL in prod.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"quick\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">10. Quick Reference</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <div class=\"my-3 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs text-slate-400\"><span>python</span></div><pre class=\"overflow-x-auto p-4 text-[13px] leading-relaxed\"><code>-- pagination (keyset)\nSELECT * FROM posts\nWHERE (created_at, id) &lt; (:last_ts, :last_id)\nORDER BY created_at DESC, id DESC\nLIMIT 20;\n\n-- top N per group\nSELECT * FROM (\n  SELECT *, DENSE_RANK() OVER (PARTITION BY dept ORDER BY salary DESC) rk\n  FROM emp\n) t WHERE rk &lt;= 3;\n\n-- upsert (Postgres)\nINSERT INTO t(id, v) VALUES (1, &#x27;a&#x27;)\nON CONFLICT (id) DO UPDATE SET v = EXCLUDED.v;\n\n-- read-committed to serializable\nBEGIN ISOLATION LEVEL SERIALIZABLE;</code></pre></div>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"review\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Cheat Sheet Review</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p><strong>Printable summary:</strong> Ctrl / \u2318 + P \u2192 print \u2014 the two pages are laid out for A4.</p>\n        <p><strong>SQL quick reference:</strong> keep the syntax block in section 1 visible while writing queries.</p>\n        <p><strong>Top 100 keywords:</strong> ACID \u00b7 ANALYZE \u00b7 BCNF \u00b7 B-tree \u00b7 BRIN \u00b7 buffer \u00b7 CAP \u00b7 CASCADE \u00b7 CTE \u00b7 candidate \u00b7 check \u00b7 clustered \u00b7 concurrency \u00b7 covering \u00b7 CROSS \u00b7 DDL \u00b7 DML \u00b7 DCL \u00b7 DEFAULT \u00b7 deadlock \u00b7 DENSE_RANK \u00b7 deferrable \u00b7 deletion \u00b7 DISTINCT \u00b7 durable \u00b7 ENUM \u00b7 EXPLAIN \u00b7 foreign \u00b7 FULL JOIN \u00b7 GiST \u00b7 GIN \u00b7 GROUP BY \u00b7 hash \u00b7 HAVING \u00b7 heap \u00b7 INDEX \u00b7 INNER \u00b7 INSERT \u00b7 IN vs EXISTS \u00b7 isolation \u00b7 JSONB \u00b7 keyset \u00b7 LATERAL \u00b7 LEFT JOIN \u00b7 LIKE \u00b7 LIMIT \u00b7 MERGE \u00b7 materialized view \u00b7 MVCC \u00b7 NoSQL \u00b7 NOT NULL \u00b7 normal form \u00b7 NULL \u00b7 OFFSET \u00b7 optimistic \u00b7 ORDER BY \u00b7 outer \u00b7 pagination \u00b7 PARTITION \u00b7 PostgreSQL \u00b7 primary \u00b7 prepared \u00b7 projection \u00b7 quorum \u00b7 Raft \u00b7 replication \u00b7 RIGHT JOIN \u00b7 RLS \u00b7 ROLLBACK \u00b7 row \u00b7 schema \u00b7 SELECT \u00b7 SERIAL \u00b7 serializable \u00b7 sharding \u00b7 savepoint \u00b7 SQL injection \u00b7 statistics \u00b7 surrogate \u00b7 TOAST \u00b7 transaction \u00b7 TRUNCATE \u00b7 UNIQUE \u00b7 UPDATE \u00b7 UPSERT \u00b7 VACUUM \u00b7 view \u00b7 WAL \u00b7 WHERE \u00b7 window \u00b7 write-skew \u00b7 XA \u00b7 YAGNI \u00b7 zero-downtime \u00b7 pg_stat_statements \u00b7 pgvector \u00b7 pg_dump \u00b7 pg_restore.</p>\n        <p><strong>Daily developer reference:</strong> print, laminate, keep on your desk.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"faqs\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">FAQ</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <details class=\"group my-2 rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-card p-4 open:shadow-sm\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-semibold\"><span>Is this printable?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition group-open:rotate-90\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"/></svg></summary><div class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Yes \u2014 a two-page A4 layout.</div></details>\n        <details class=\"group my-2 rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-card p-4 open:shadow-sm\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-semibold\"><span>Where do I learn each item?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition group-open:rotate-90\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"/></svg></summary><div class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Follow the linked resources \u2014 \u201cDBMS \u2014 Reference Guide\u201d explains each section in depth.</div></details>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"references\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">References</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">\n          <li>PostgreSQL, MySQL, Oracle, SQL Server documentation</li>\n          <li>Silberschatz, Korth & Sudarshan \u2014 Database System Concepts</li>\n          <li>Elmasri & Navathe \u2014 Fundamentals of Database Systems</li>\n          <li>CMU 15-445, MIT OCW 6.830</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"disclaimer\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Disclaimer</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">\n          This resource is intended for educational purposes only. Information is compiled from official\n          documentation, academic publications, research papers, industry standards, and trusted educational\n    